Modifications made for MiniCam integration:
- imu_shim.js (new): WebSocket client injecting MPU6050 IMU data into AstroHopper
- astrohopper.html: bug fixes (manual_tr_en, unsupported(), DeviceOrientationEvent
  guard), service worker disabled, back button added
- jsdb.js (new): star catalog generated from OpenNGC + western_constellations_atlas_of_space

